r, la memoria y las reparaciones.","synopsis_lang":"es","poster":"/assets/mambe-2026/la-memoria-de-las-mariposas.jpg","posterSource":"tmdb","_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfIOLhBloOw/","date":"2026-10-30","lamina":5},"lbSlug":"the-memory-of-butterflies","tmdb_id":1418601,"synopsis_en":"A photo of two indigenous boys brought by force to Europe opens an investigation of the past with meditations on the filmmaker’s own family using roughly textured analogue footage. A monument for the indigenous victims of the rubber trade in Peru.","title_en":"The Memory of Butterflies","id":"f_8375220d16","is_free":true,"work_id":"w_R4KQGMB4710G"},{"title":"Taller: Cine Comunitario","type":"event","section":"🎪 Actividades","duration":"180 min","day":"2026-11-06","time":"09:00","day_order":3,"venue":"Biblioteca SENA - Florencia","event_kind":"taller","is_recurring":true,"has_qa":false,"_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfIOLhBloOw/","date":"2026-10-30","lamina":6},"id":"f_a07e292564","is_free":true},{"title":"Encuentro: Taller Mujeres Buscadoras","type":"event","section":"🎪 Actividades","duration":"180 min","day":"2026-11-06","time":"09:00","day_order":3,"venue":"Casa Campesina - Florencia","event_kind":"encuentro","has_qa":false,"_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfIOLhBloOw/","date":"2026-10-30","lamina":6},"id":"f_69f5e0db88","is_free":true},{"title":"Taller Actuación: María Cecilia Sanchez","type":"event","section":"🎪 Actividades","duration":"180 min","day":"2026-11-06","time":"15:00","day_order":3,"venue":"Uniamazonia Sede Centro - Florencia","sala":"Edificio Yapura - Sala 17, piso 7","event_kind":"taller","is_recurring":true,"has_qa":false,"_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfIOLhBloOw/","date":"2026-10-30","lamina":6},"id":"f_6dd8ac0000","is_free":true},{"title":"Soñé su nombre","type":"film","section":"🌿 Proyecciones","director":"Ángela Carabalí","year":2026,"country":"Colombia","flags":"🇨🇴","duration":"180 min","genre":"Documental","day":"2026-11-06","time":"16:00","day_order":3,"venue":"Uniamazonia Sede Centro - Florencia","sala":"Auditorio Callicebus","has_qa":true,"synopsis":"Después de 30 años negando su dolor, Ángela se enfrenta a su pasado cuando su padre, en un sueño, le pide que lo busque. Junto a su hermana Juliana, emprende un viaje a través de Colombia hasta las tierras indígenas donde su padre, un agricultor afrodescendiente, fue víctima de desaparición forzada.  Mientras las hermanas atraviesan el país, no solo vemos los paisajes contrastantes de Colombia, sino que también se entablan conversaciones que revelan el perfil de su padre, Esaú Carabalí Brand: un arrocero independiente, rebelde y víctima de un robo crucial. En el camino, descubren un inesperado archivo sonoro familiar y hacen una parada en la casa de su introspectiva abuela paterna.  Días después, las hermanas salen del territorio, habiendo encontrado el amor, el legado de su padre y una comunidad atravesada por la violencia que aún resiste manteniendo una conexión profunda con su tierra y su alimento.","synopsis_lang":"es","poster":"/assets/mambe-2026/sone-su-nombre.jpg","posterSource":"tmdb","_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfIOLhBloOw/","date":"2026-10-30","lamina":7},"lbSlug":"i-dreamed-his-name","tmdb_id":1454365,"synopsis_en":"Thirty years after his forced disappearance, the filmmaker’s Afro Colombian father comes to her in a dream, asking her to find him. With her sister, she sets out on a journey of discovery across Colombia’s painful history, reconnecting with their father and his activism.","title_en":"I Dreamed His Name","id":"f_fceb45d866","is_free":true,"work_id":"w_R4HKHDXFCZNZ"},{"title":"Taller: Serigrafía","type":"event","section":"🎪 Actividades","duration":"150 min","day":"2026-11-06","time":"17:00","day_order":3,"venue":"Uniamazonia Sede Centro - Florencia","sala":"Auditorio Callicebus","event_kind":"taller","is_recurring":true,"has_qa":false,"_src":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfIOLhBloOw/",